{"format":"helia-content","version":1,"id":"hylomorphism-profunctor","title":{"Inline":[{"Text":"The hylomorphism profunctor"}]},"title_text":"The hylomorphism profunctor","kind":"definition","taxon":null,"url":"hylomorphism-profunctor.html","content":{"Block":[{"Group":{"role":"env","attrs":[["entry","hylomorphism-profunctor"],["kind","definition"],["label","Definition"],["numbered","true"]],"body":{"Block":[{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Fix an endofunctor "},{"Math":{"src":"F : cal(C) ->\ncal(C)"}},{"Text":". "},{"EntryLink":{"id":"hylomorphism","label":null,"body":[{"Text":"Hylomorphisms"}]}},{"Text":" form a profunctor from coalgebras to algebras,"}]},{"Math":{"src":"sans(\"Hylo\") : sans(\"Coalg\")(F)^(\"op\")\n× sans(\"Alg\")(F) -> bold(\"Set\") ,"}},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"where "},{"Math":{"src":"sans(\"Hylo\")((X, gamma),\n(B, alpha))"}},{"Text":" is the set of "},{"Math":{"src":"h : X -> B"}},{"Text":" with "},{"Math":{"src":"h = gamma ⋆ F h ⋆\nalpha"}},{"Text":"."}]},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"The action is by composition. If "},{"Math":{"src":"g : (Y, delta) -> (X, gamma)"}},{"Text":" is a "},{"EntryLink":{"id":"coalgebras-displayed","label":null,"body":[{"Text":"coalgebra morphism"}]}},{"Text":" ("},{"Math":{"src":"g ⋆ gamma =\ndelta ⋆ F g"}},{"Text":") and "},{"Math":{"src":"k : (B, alpha) -> (B', alpha')"}},{"Text":" is an "},{"EntryLink":{"id":"algebras-displayed","label":null,"body":[{"Text":"algebra morphism"}]}},{"Text":" ("},{"Math":{"src":"alpha ⋆ k = F k\n⋆ alpha'"}},{"Text":"), then "},{"Math":{"src":"g ⋆ h ⋆ k"}},{"Text":" is again a hylomorphism:"}]},{"Math":{"src":"delta ⋆ F (g ⋆\nh ⋆ k) ⋆ alpha'\n  = delta ⋆ F g ⋆ F h ⋆ alpha ⋆ k\n  = g ⋆ gamma ⋆ F h ⋆ alpha ⋆ k\n  = g ⋆ h ⋆ k ."}},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"In these terms, a coalgebra "},{"Math":{"src":"gamma"}},{"Text":" is "},{"EntryLink":{"id":"recursive-coalgebra","label":null,"body":[{"Text":"recursive"}]}},{"Text":" when "},{"Math":{"src":"sans(\"Hylo\")(gamma, -)"}},{"Text":" is the terminal functor, and an algebra "},{"Math":{"src":"alpha"}},{"Text":" is "},{"EntryLink":{"id":"corecursive-algebra","label":null,"body":[{"Text":"corecursive"}]}},{"Text":" when "},{"Math":{"src":"sans(\"Hylo\")(-,\nalpha)"}},{"Text":" is. For the inverse of an initial algebra the profunctor is representable, "},{"Math":{"src":"sans(\"Hylo\")(sans(\"in\")^(-1), -) ≅\nsans(\"Alg\")(F)(sans(\"in\"), -)"}},{"Text":", and dually "},{"Math":{"src":"sans(\"Hylo\")(-,\nsans(\"out\")^(-1)) ≅ sans(\"Coalg\")(F)(-, sans(\"out\"))"}},{"Text":" for a terminal coalgebra."}]},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"When "},{"Emph":[{"Text":"every"}]},{"Text":" value of "},{"Math":{"src":"sans(\"Hylo\")"}},{"Text":" is a singleton, every divide-and-conquer specification over "},{"Math":{"src":"F"}},{"Text":" has exactly one solution. This is what "},{"Span":{"role":"","attrs":[],"body":[{"Text":"local contractivity"}]}},{"Text":" guarantees."}]}]}}}]}}
